     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for your help.<div>At the end I decided to change the names of the columns to fixed names using:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">df</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">df</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;<a href=\"http://old.var.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://old.var.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792357546800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fE1NJS-fnOq7lRO5YzFyM\">old.var.name</a>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;<a href=\"http://new.var.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://new.var.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792357546800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11IU_WsyE3ah2bRcXkWlk0\">new.var.name</a>&#39;</span></code></pre></div><div> so I could work in the same way as I did before.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div>Ayala</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, June 25, 2015 at 7:18:13 PM UTC+3, Brandon Hurr wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I would say that you should maybe use standard evaluation. The input of standard evaluation could be the name of that column in quotes.<div><br></div><div>So group_by_() instead of group_by(). </div><div>id = &quot;something&quot;</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">test1 &lt;- raw_data_rt %&gt;%</code></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> group_by_(id) %&gt;%</code></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> summarise(n = mean(rt[abs(z_score) &lt; 1])) %&gt;%</code></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> dcast(subject ~ &quot;t1rt&quot;, value.var = &quot;n&quot;, fun = mean)</code></div></div><div><br></div><div>See:</div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>vignette(&quot;nse&quot;)<br></p><p><span>I don&#39;t know if you can mix NSE and SE so this may not work, but you didn&#39;t provide a dataset to play with either and I&#39;m feeling lazy today.</span></p><p>HTH,</p><p>B <br></p></div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Jun 25, 2015 at 5:28 AM, Ayala Allon <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">ayala...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hey,<br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px\">I&#39;m doing the following using dplyr and it works great:</span></div><div><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">test1 &lt;- raw_data_rt %&gt;%</code></div><div><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> group_by(subject) %&gt;%</code></div><div><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> summarise(n = mean(rt[abs(z_score) &lt; 1])) %&gt;%</code></div><div><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> dcast(subject ~ &quot;t1rt&quot;, value.var = &quot;n&quot;, fun = mean)</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px\">. </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px\"><br></span></div><div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">&gt; head(test1)</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">  subject      t1rt</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">1      99  999.3180</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">2    5203  929.3739</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">3    5205 1124.2645</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">4    5306  978.6618</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">5    5307 1120.1499</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.8999996185303px\">6    5308 1019.4909</span></font></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.8999996185303px\"><br></span></div><div><s